+  the guess (largest − k) ÷ k both average (N − k) ÷ (k + 1), so the estimates
+  average exactly N, for every N of at least k." The same recipe,
+  m(1 + 1/k) − 1, is Clark, Gonye and Miller (2021), p. 3 (`G-F3.estimate`'s
